# Every image here is built with the repo root as context (see each
# Dockerfile's header comment), so host-side build/test artifacts under any
# COPY'd directory would otherwise leak straight into the image — most
# concretely, frontend/node_modules installed by running npm/npx locally
# clobbers the container's own freshly `npm ci`'d one in frontend/Dockerfile's
# `COPY frontend .` step, and loses its executable bit crossing the Windows
# host -> Linux build-VM boundary, breaking `tsc` with "Permission denied".
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
.venv
**/.venv
.git
